  "description": "Charter is a durable low maintenance single speed aluminum rental cruiser built to last. This bike is packed full of rust-proof, corrosion-resistant alloy parts so you can focus on renting your fleet over and over again and less time doing maintenance.\n\nCharter also features a unisex step thru frame with a welded plate and removable decal so you can advertise your brand!\n\nThe 26\" Charter is the bread and butter of your fleet. It's uni-sex step-thru frame fits a wide range of rider heights. Some key features on this models include aluminum frame, sealed precision headset, quick-release seat post clamp, 26\"x3\" smooth rolling tires, 13g stainless steel spokes, ergo grips etc..",
